        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K539-KIN, Kingsman Lever with Quaker Escutcheon Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Brass Accents, the Kingsman Leverset with Quaker Backplate features a crystal lever. It is this unique touch that separates this latchset from all others. The elegance of the lever paired with the simple, yet beautiful Quaker Plate makes for something that is truly special. The Quaker Collection Plate is 2-1/4 inches wide and 7 inches tall. It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/quaker-solid-brass-latchset-brass-accents-d07-k539\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D07-K539-KIN Quaker Plate with Crystal Kingsman Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
