                "description": "Brass Accents D07-K539-KIN , Kingsman Leverset with Quaker Backplate - Made by Brass Accents, the Kingsman Leverset with Quaker Backplate features a crystal lever. It is this unique touch that separates this latchset from all others. The elegance of the lever paired with the simple, yet beautiful Quaker Plate makes for something that is truly special. The Quaker Collection Plate is 2-1/4 inches wide and 7 inches tall. It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
